{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46812","headline":"谢孙郎中寄示 · 齐己","name":"谢孙郎中寄示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一念禅余味国风，早因持论偶名公。\n久伤琴丧人亡後，忽有云和雪唱同。\n绳琢静闻罤象外，是非闲见寂寥中。\n时来日往缘真趣，不觉秋江度塞鸿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}